  ✓ Audit provenance, program fidelity, translation identity, and differential behavior
  ✓ Reconstruct definitions and independently rerun all positive claims
  ✓ Review claim adequacy, real-program pinning, and concrete witnesses
  ✓ Inventory and statically audit every relevant K declaration and rule
  ✓ Create and run a fresh meaningful false mutation for non-vacuity
  → Account for proven versus assumed boundaries and write REVIEW.md
